  "originalQuery": "You are managing a Cloud Spanner instance for a global logistics company. Shipments are logged in real-time, and each shipment entry has a unique shipmentId and associated regionId . You need to create a flexible query to fetch details for a specific shipment in a given region. The query must be optimized for frequent use. What should you do?",
  "originalOptions": "A. SELECT * FROM shipments WHERE shipmentId=@shipmentId OR regionId=@regionId<br/>B. SELECT * FROM shipments WHERE shipmentId=@shipmentId AND regionId=@regionId<br/>C. SELECT * FROM shipments WHERE shipmentId LIKE @shipmentId AND regionId='EU'<br/>D. SELECT * FROM shipments WHERE shipmentId=@shipmentId AND regionId='EU'",
