  "qid": "251",
  "tip": "<p>When a question asks for one item within a scope use <i>AND</i> with <i>parameters</i> for each filter. Avoid <i>OR</i> when you need a narrow lookup and avoid hardcoded values. Use <i>FORCE_INDEX</i> only when you have evidence the default plan is not optimal.</p>",
